tings":{"text":"<p>With over 20 years of experience in the field of hydronic floor heating, we have had the opportunity to see almost everything, which has allowed us to refine our practice and to discern the good products from the not so good. <\/p><p>For this reason, all the products that we are offering are manufactured by reputable and top quality manufacturers and present the following features:<\/p><ul><li>Reliability and durability<\/li><li>Ease of diagnosis in the event of a problem<\/li><li>Ease of maintenance and repair<\/li><li>Monitoring features<\/li><li>Ease of installation<\/li><\/ul><p>And, in order to fill a lack of quality products at affordable prices on the market, we became a manufacturer of our own line of <em><strong>Nordik Radiant<\/strong><\/em> products. These products offer exceptional value for money<\/p>","enlarge_text":true}}},"block_order":["template--14763459838036__fb0bdf76-b055-4d23-b67e-3d3c8ac156c2-subheading-1","template--14763459838036__fb0bdf76-b055-4d23-b67e-3d3c8ac156c2-text-1"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"wide":false,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"85e7cee0-a247-4083-ab90-be25f88d6050":{"type":"promo-strip","blocks":{"template--14763459838036__85e7cee0-a247-4083-ab90-be25f88d6050-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<h4>Heating Smart With Radiant Floor<\/h4>","enlarge_text":true,"show_on_mobile":true,"show_on_desktop":true}}},"block_order":["template--14763459838036__85e7cee0-a247-4083-ab90-be25f88d6050-text-1"],"settings":{"section_height":"default","color_scheme":"2","full_width":true,"dividers":"border-top","prevent_animation":false}},"72f115ff-32c6-4531-b5d7-3cf8c0002613":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14763459838036__72f115ff-32c6-4531-b5d7-3cf8c0002613-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Whether you are a self-builder, a contractor or a plumber, select the components of your radiant floor with the help of one of our specialists to obtain an efficient and durable system and get the best on the market!<\/p><p>You are not comfortable designing your system yourself? Request a quote for a complete system!<\/p>","enlarge_text":true}},"template--14763459838036__72f115ff-32c6-4531-b5d7-3cf8c0002613-button-1":{"type":"button","settings":{"button_1_label":"Get a quote","button_1_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/quote-request","button_1_style":"btn--primary","button_2_label":"Shop your components","button_2_link":"shopify:\/\/collections","button_2_style":"btn btn--primary"}}},"block_order":["template--14763459838036__72f115ff-32c6-4531-b5d7-3cf8c0002613-text-1","template--14763459838036__72f115ff-32c6-4531-b5d7-3cf8c0002613-button-1"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"wide":false,"color_scheme":"1","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"493ca5e7-6d7e-41bf-826a-23fbded04b0d":{"type":"promo-strip","blocks":{"template--14763459838036__493ca5e7-6d7e-41bf-826a-23fbded04b0d-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Our team is happy to be able to share with you this knowledge acquired over all these years in the field of hydronic heating. So, if you need assistance in choosing your components, we will be happy to advise you<\/p>","enlarge_text":true,"show_on_mobile":true,"show_on_desktop":true}}},"block_order":["template--14763459838036__493ca5e7-6d7e-41bf-826a-23fbded04b0d-text-1"],"settings":{"section_height":"default","color_scheme":"3","full_width":true,"dividers":"border-top","prevent_animation":false}},"promo_strip_MJDbgC":{"type":"promo-strip","blocks":{"text_kjUW8X":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"","enlarge_text":true,"show_on_mobile":true,"show_on_desktop":true}}},"block_order":["text_kjUW8X"],"settings":{"section_height":"default","color_scheme":"1","full_width":true,"dividers":"border-top","prevent_animation":false}}},"order":["main","66a8cff0-dae4-4e6c-9d26-2c3a25fd5eab","f8a2c5b2-0d48